# Agent ownership

Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [JOB_CONTRACT.md](JOB_CONTRACT.md) before editing either mobile app.

- One writer per path. Do not share the 4.3k service-form clones, customer `booked-services.tsx`, or provider `landing.tsx`.
- No mid-task app hop. A session writes `apps/customer-app` **or** `apps/serviceprovider-app`, not both. Cross-app work: update `JOB_CONTRACT.md`, then a new session.
- Do not invent `service.status` spellings. Use `helpr_otw`, not `on_the_way`. New statuses, columns, or function payloads go in `JOB_CONTRACT.md` first.
- Do not extract a shared `packages/` module or align Expo 54/57 as a side quest.
- Website is isolated. Do not touch either app from a website session.

Delegate lane work to the project subagents in `.cursor/agents/` (A–F).
